Published original: https://lemomo-ai.github.io/lemo-opuscar/films/paper-popup.mp4

Attributed generic toolkit (MIT): styles/paper-popup/demo/book.js (hinged book and curled sheet geometry only; original coverCanvases is not called), cutmesh.js (alpha-tested card depth and paper backs), paper.js (canvas grain, cut borders and shape utilities), post.js (physical depth of field/bloom), their transitive generic lib.js, and core/lib.js (deterministic math/interpolation). Original art.js, actors.js, sets.js, story.js, hud.js and main.js are not runtime dependencies. Published camera key coordinates are reference data, independently evaluated with generic interpolation. All new drawings, character assembly, sets, acting, scene control, overlays and score are in this replica directory.

